{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "d1479875e0da2825e343c97d0be31e7c92a7e5940e08adbaf04c131bbd829e8e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れ様です。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1778018b5fb1f7006fae7db112c67b1ef0a02ec561cdf1056fb75b77db9962ff", "ja": "青羽さん。お疲れ様です。\n今、何か悲しそうな顔をされてませんでした？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n刚才是不是看起来有点难过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "df21a1652919a28cc4aa8e1795e8b700984a5e58635c42219080d2ea4a63f5a4", "ja": "え、そんな顔してましたか？　ただ昨日見た\n恋愛ドラマのことを思い出してただけなんですけどね。", "zh": "咦，我刚才是那副表情吗？只是在回想昨天看的恋爱剧而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "bc4f57367744c29da8d6d559f2aa6b4115491eb64dd2d4b62e3edd36f45c5d4d", "ja": "今、ちょうど主人公が失恋したところで。\n続きが気になって仕方ないんですよ！", "zh": "现在正好演到主人公失恋的地方。\n我实在太想知道后续了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "06b5101d20ad43de227eb2ed8caf4a8d19eb9d236891241a5502e28870a5f054", "ja": "なるほど。失恋ですか……。その主人公にはつらい\n思いを乗り越えて、幸せになってほしいですね。", "zh": "原来如此。失恋了啊……真希望那位主人公能克服痛苦，获得幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a3bc86780c156f7f60fb55cf0ed608fbcbefbc2528bff8d5f0a9734a6c3d9bcc", "ja": "そうですそうです！　私もちょうどそんな風に\n思って……あ！　社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "没错没错！我也正是这么想的……啊！社长叫您过去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "64fb92d75038f8678346c8982450c363c0fdee7436bac5d079c92c7a43b445f9", "ja": "おっと、そうでしたか。ではさっそく行ってきます。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。那我这就过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "a0d2044634d1b70aba683841653e070b2b6e2361091abe4a8c760627822a5afc", "ja": "行ってらっしゃ～い♪\n失恋に気をつけてくださいね～！", "zh": "慢走～♪\n小心别失恋哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "a6cea4d2588aa7bccf39366816e1020c0d666f07d83696d8f7ab6025df9358d7", "ja": "やあ、君。寒い中よく来てくれたね！\nちょっと暖房の温度を上げようか。", "zh": "嗨，你来啦。天气这么冷，辛苦你过来了！\n要不要把暖气温度调高一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "2aa91636f9a1d22316e61632cdff029a16e35646aa1d9aa516659800e32cacb5", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！\n熱いお茶をどうぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n请喝热茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4e80b7062c69f831f9da2a9308e88a63b4d40db76b292dd6324147a5bd0a3fd5", "ja": "お気遣いありがとうございます！\nところで、何か企画があると聞いたのですが。", "zh": "谢谢您的关心！\n对了，我听说好像有什么企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "1acc47499e0591258b311219fb52d0fc790857d35985de5606205c02b951c356", "ja": "お、話が早いね。実は私の古い馴染みから、\nなんとも味わい深い、良い曲を提供されてね！", "zh": "哦，进展真快啊。其实，我的一位老相识给我提供了一首非常有韵味的好歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "8e71d3f2b080abd1258b3c469d42051b862a2bd8f101b2d0077eff717b63f5fe", "ja": "せつなくって、とってもいい曲なんですよ！\nああ、思い出したら胸がいっぱいに……。", "zh": "是一首很伤感、特别好听的歌呢！\n啊，一想起来就满心感慨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "ac9092622f73f3c66515ae1d5bad15f35e42f922698a736733c39fb7e7d65aad", "ja": "わかるよ、音無君。それで、我が765プロライブ劇場\nの公演で、その曲を是非使いたいと思っているんだ。", "zh": "我明白，音无君。所以，我很想在我们765Pro Live剧场的公演中用上那首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0bcd2bdeaa829d76ceb8c5edc33efcb817e4be148ae23d4b64fa68083e22563f", "ja": "なるほど。せつない曲は、この寒い季節にも\n合いそうです。人選はどうしますか？", "zh": "原来如此。伤感的歌曲似乎也很适合这个寒冷的季节。人员安排怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "825dc6d75b53c5b3bc3ea3fbd3548608475a5f24babb6efb38e914259bbc5b38", "ja": "それなんだが、デュオにしたくてね。\n誰と誰に歌ってもらうかは、君のセンスに任せたい。", "zh": "不过，我想做成二重唱。\n至于让谁和谁来演唱，就交给你的品味了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "97372672c1ec03c76ed5a8ea38e2cb465fde821c0a4f785889f25d1432f72b3f", "ja": "いいんですか。プロデューサー冥利に尽きます。\nじっくり考えて決めなきゃ……。", "zh": "真的可以交给我吗？这真是身为制作人的无上荣幸。\n必须得好好考虑再做决定才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "3967e1ea4fc9e5f5f147417167eb2aa9592dfea4b1f80e1f5d02e1e4705dd8c1", "ja": "王道を狙うか、意外性を狙うか……。まぁ、君の見立て\nなら間違いないだろう。頑張ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "是瞄准王道，还是追求出人意料……不过，既然是你的判断，应该不会错。加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0cf92e939895bc0949ac44c6d8494d1b93784f445c57b39b907490a74332d6ba", "ja": "はい！　頑張りますっ！", "zh": "好的！我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8cd980fc6e7df2748e8af6b5853e99557371149654b2c477557090759bcfede9", "ja": "……あれ？　関係ないんですけど、音無さんの\n机にあるのって、今話題のドラマですよね？", "zh": "……咦？虽然和这个没关系，但音无小姐桌上放着的，是最近很热门的电视剧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "b1dd21388b30148428c85145bf3918a53070bb763b0b516f9b8b84ea456274a8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんもご存じでしたか！\nこれ、ハマってるんですよね～。", "zh": "啊，您也知道{$P$}先生啊！我最近正沉迷这个呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "da6d697537d4f118773b5502acb92c0059e04c5b8953df8230ecadc28c34ecca", "ja": "悲恋ものなんですけど、泣けて泣けて……。\n美咲ちゃんと一緒に盛り上がってるんです♪", "zh": "虽然是悲恋题材，但真的让人忍不住哭……我正和美咲酱一起看得起劲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cb29fee9280dd992b3e9fd666cb7fe107361b032427c051977aa866fd883b005", "ja": "ああ、それですか！\n青羽さんが言ってた恋愛ドラマって。", "zh": "啊，是那个啊！\n青羽小姐之前提到的恋爱电视剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "6ee6e730b30dba80ef758dafa7bda7e783881e1ed7ad6a92674d642056bf53cf", "ja": "なんだね、そんなに面白いドラマなのかい？\n私もちょっと観てみたいなぁ。", "zh": "哦？那部电视剧真的那么有意思吗？\n我也有点想看看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "3d33983ebb6d8e711432d324d6806e97b27e1695f481c320bcd810dd00725093", "ja": "社長も観ましょう！　はい、これ1巻です♪", "zh": "社长也一起看吧！来，这是第1卷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "3631339a62674b1439a596585fddd2574fb37d99682bef610171a32533ba0b72", "ja": "おお、ありがとう！　ふふふ、恋愛ものは久しぶりだ。\n今日帰ったら、さっそく観てみるよ。", "zh": "哦，谢谢！呵呵，恋爱题材的作品，好久没看了。\n今天回去后，我马上就去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "5eeb4b2b8c7fe320c536caff2d3d4413229e53494d21d2e3a7b5e712178c0e57", "ja": "なにごとも勉強だからね。この業界にいる限り、\n常にエンタメのアンテナを張っていなくては！", "zh": "凡事皆是学习嘛。只要身处这个行业，就必须时刻保持对娱乐资讯的敏锐触觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "55f8848c76f5dffcd0dcc075dcbf17b698f9e44a3c443d3698b6def4a8400484", "ja": "社長……さすがです！　音無さん、もしよければ\n社長の次に、俺にも貸してください。", "zh": "社长……真不愧是您！音无小姐，如果方便的话，\n等社长看完，也借给我看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "6c9db61de223f91c5be2d3020cbd4608131a0c5530d8b8828b2e3da21998c237", "ja": "もちろんです！　本当にいい物語なので、\nぜひ感想を聞かせてください♪", "zh": "当然可以！这真的是个很棒的故事，\n请务必告诉我您的感想♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a6f882fcb8386ec5ea381c98aee44ed37589917f98753c1aadd4cfb9252793fe", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　……あ、話がそれて\nしまいましたが、次の公演の件、頑張りますね。", "zh": "谢谢！……啊，话题扯远了，不过下次公演的事，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "86744bf2a9f0bee63477b887970fa1d5fbfc8615a21db0736f25a9026558ecc7", "ja": "うむ！　きっといいものになるはずだ。\n期待しているよ～！", "zh": "嗯！一定会非常出色的。\n我很期待哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "29f8156681e96e482e523576082a09d68131276d4ed53573b1ea024813f2e205", "ja": "（さて、まずは曲を聴いて、メンバーのイメージを\n膨らませよう。忙しくなるぞ！）", "zh": "（那么，先听听歌曲，丰富一下成员们的形象吧。\n接下来可要忙起来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
